			],
			"Message": "docs(Common): Document UIShowInputBoxRequest and UIShowQuickPickRequest as deprecated aliases\n\nAdd explanatory comments in SkyEvent.rs clarifying that these channel names are deprecated aliases pointing to the newer `InputBoxShow` and `QuickPickShow` channels declared earlier in the enum. The old channel names remain available for backward compatibility with older code paths and tests.\n\nThis improves maintainability by making the deprecation status explicit in the codebase.",
